 has corner and face-center sites. Its spacing and orientation are for display; it does not represent a calculated alloy state, and adding elements does not relabel the FCC Al sites. Opening Composition widens the workspace on desktop. The lattice smoothly magnifies by 30% as it dims to 16% opacity. Later steps retain this view; returning to the family step restores the original framing. Reduced motion applies the framing immediately, and magnified caches retain native pixel density. Leaving the optimizer preserves the selected reference lattice during the return transition.
